    {"name_ja":"クレブス回路（TCAサイクル）","name_en":"Krebs Cycle (TCA Cycle)","name_original":None,"definition":"アセチルCoAを完全酸化してCO2・NADH・FADH2・ATPを生成するミトコンドリア内の8段階循環代謝経路。クレブスが1937年に発見。","impact_summary":"好気性代謝の中枢。アミノ酸・脂質代謝との交差点。クレブスの1953年ノーベル賞。","subfield":"生命科学・生物学","school_of_thought":"生化学","era_start":1937,"culture_region":"Europe_Western","source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Citric_acid_cycle","mathematical_formulation":r"\text{Acetyl-CoA}+3\text{NAD}^++\text{FAD}+\text{ADP}+\text{P}_i\to2\text{CO}_2+3\text{NADH}+\text{FADH}_2+\text{ATP}","verification_status":"url_present","data_completeness":90},
