    {"name_ja":"CAR-T細胞療法","name_en":"CAR-T Cell Therapy","name_original":"Chimeric Antigen Receptor T-cell","definition":"患者のT細胞に人工的なキメラ抗原受容体（CAR）遺伝子を導入し、がん細胞を特異的に攻撃させる養子免疫細胞療法。","impact_summary":"B細胞性リンパ腫・急性リンパ性白血病の難治例で60-90%完全奏効率。固形癌への拡大が課題。","subfield":"生命科学・生物学","school_of_thought":"免疫学","era_start":2011,"culture_region":"Americas_North","source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CAR_T_cell","mathematical_formulation":r"\text{CAR: }V_H\text{-linker-}V_L\text{-spacer-TM-4-1BB-CD3}\zeta","verification_status":"url_present","data_completeness":88},
    {"name_ja":"シングルセルRNAシーケンシング（scRNA-seq）","name_en":"Single-Cell RNA Sequencing","name_original":"scRNA-seq","definition":"個々の細胞のトランスクリプトームを解析して細胞型・状態・軌跡を解明する技術。10x Genomicsなどのマイクロ流体法で数万細胞を同時測定。","impact_summary":"脳・免疫・発生の細胞地図（Cell Atlas）構築。腫瘍内不均一性・免疫回避・発生軌跡の解明に革命。","subfield":"生命科学・生物学","school_of_thought":"ゲノミクス","era_start":2009,"culture_region":"Europe_Western","source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Single-cell_RNA_sequencing","mathematical_formulation":r"\text{Cell barcode + UMI} \to\text{count matrix (cells}\times\text{genes)}","verification_status":"url_present","data_completeness":88},
    {"name_ja":"空間トランスクリプトミクス","name_en":"Spatial Transcriptomics","name_original":None,"definition":"組織切片上の各空間位置でのRNA発現を保ちながら網羅的に測定する技術。Visium・MERFISH・seqFISHなどが代表。2020年のサイエンス誌「ブレークスルー・オブ・ザ・イヤー」。","impact_summary":"脳・腫瘍・胚の空間的遺伝子発現地図を構築し、細胞の組織コンテキストを保った解析を可能にした。","subfield":"生命科学・生物学","school_of_thought":"ゲノミクス","era_start":2016,"culture_region":"Europe_Northern","source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spatial_transcriptomics","mathematical_formulation":r"\text{spot resolution}\sim50\mu\text{m (Visium)}\to\text{subcellular (MERFISH)}","verification_status":"url_present","data_completeness":85},
